{
  "$comment": [
    "Single source of truth for every absolute URL the site emits, and for whether the",
    "site may be indexed. Change `active` (or pass --env=<name> to the script), then run",
    "  node scripts/apply-site-config.mjs",
    "which rewrites canonicals, og:url, og:image, twitter:image, schema URLs, the robots",
    "meta tag, robots.txt and sitemap.xml across every page. Nothing else in the repo",
    "should contain a hard-coded origin.",
    "See DEPLOYMENT-CHECKLIST.md before switching `active` to \"production\"."
  ],

